==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**4 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The trick to this stage is to not allow the enemies to stack up and overwhelm your meatshields. Deploy meatshields with reliable midrangers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza cat]] to kill the enemy frontliners before they have a chance to push. Pretty much any anti-Dark ubers do well here, namely [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] makes this stage a joke since he can effectively stop the frontliners from pushing as long as the zombies are dealt with.

